        "r": 299.8259999999998,
        "b": 720.6183344167462
      },
      "content": "The USB port is located below the door next the inner air filter."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0453",
      "reading_order": 566,
      "section": "Port location",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 35.99999999999977,
        "t": 716.58301953125,
        "r": 555.7769999999997,
        "b": 696.2553344167461
      },
      "content": "The USB cover protects the USB port so that no water vapour can get into the control electronics during cooking or cleaning. During cooking and cleaning, there must not be a USB stick inserted and the USB port must be closed by the cover."
    },
    {
